      "summary": "The user has hosted bridge nights for nearly forty years and is planning an intergenerational event on Friday, January 8, 2021, with 8–10 participants, mostly older women from church and retired teachers, plus younger guests such as her grandson's friends and young professionals from the historical society. The event will include icebreakers and activities like Bridge Bingo and Bid to Laugh to create a welcoming atmosphere, and she seeks advice on reassuring longtime bridge buddies that their traditions are not being discarded.",
